---
/** Smart Posture Correction: vision on the host PC, haptics and IMU on the wearable. */
---

<figure class="diagram" data-reveal>
  <div class="diagram__scroll" data-lenis-prevent>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 320" role="img" aria-labelledby="sp-title sp-desc">
      <title id="sp-title">Smart Posture Correction system</title>
      <desc id="sp-desc">
        A camera feeds a host PC running a Python, OpenCV and dlib face-pose pipeline that classifies posture. The
        result goes over UDP on Wi-Fi to a XIAO ESP32-C3 on the wearable, which also reads an MPU6050 IMU. The
        ESP32 drives a vibration motor through a transistor driver, and reports to the Blynk platform for a phone
        dashboard and alerts.
      </desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="sp-arrow" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7.5" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 z" class="d-head"></path>
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <rect class="d-box" x="0" y="60" width="130" height="80"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="65" y="105" text-anchor="middle">CAMERA</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M130 100 H180" marker-end="url(#sp-arrow)"></path>

      <rect class="d-box" x="180" y="40" width="270" height="120"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="198" y="72">HOST PC</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="198" y="98">Python · OpenCV + dlib</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="198" y="115">face-pose estimation</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="198" y="132">→ posture class</text>

      <path class="d-line d-line--key" d="M450 100 H560" marker-end="url(#sp-arrow)"></path>
      <text class="d-k" x="505" y="90" text-anchor="middle">UDP · WI-FI</text>

      <rect class="d-box d-box--key" x="560" y="40" width="190" height="120"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="578" y="72">XIAO ESP32-C3</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="578" y="98">wearable PCB</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="578" y="115">C++ firmware</text>

      <path class="d-line" d="M750 100 H800" marker-end="url(#sp-arrow)"></path>
      <rect class="d-box" x="800" y="60" width="160" height="80"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="880" y="97" text-anchor="middle">DRIVER</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="880" y="115" text-anchor="middle">S8050 transistor</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M960 100 H1010" marker-end="url(#sp-arrow)"></path>
      <rect class="d-box" x="1010" y="60" width="190" height="80"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="1105" y="97" text-anchor="middle">VIBRATION</text>
      <text class="d-t" x="1105" y="115" text-anchor="middle">MOTOR</text>

      <!-- IMU into the ESP32 -->
      <rect class="d-box" x="330" y="220" width="170" height="60"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="415" y="248" text-anchor="middle">MPU6050</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="415" y="265" text-anchor="middle">IMU</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M500 250 H615 V160" marker-end="url(#sp-arrow)"></path>

      <!-- Monitoring -->
      <path class="d-line" d="M700 160 V250 H800" marker-end="url(#sp-arrow)"></path>
      <rect class="d-box" x="800" y="220" width="160" height="60"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="880" y="248" text-anchor="middle">BLYNK</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="880" y="265" text-anchor="middle">IoT platform</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M960 250 H1010" marker-end="url(#sp-arrow)"></path>
      <rect class="d-box" x="1010" y="220" width="190" height="60"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="1105" y="248" text-anchor="middle">PHONE</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="1105" y="265" text-anchor="middle">dashboard, alerts</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>System diagram. The heavy vision work stays on the PC; the wearable only receives a result.</figcaption>
</figure>
